{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10124420","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10124420","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1012442001:0":{"text":"どうやら、フォレストエッグを手に入れたようじゃのう。","source_cn":"看样子，你们成功得到了翡绿之卵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8430CFA2B195E63B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1012442002:1":{"text":"先生、なぜこれがフォレストエッグだと？","source_cn":"贤者，您怎么知道这是翡绿之卵？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF2B45B6174EAB49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012442003:1":{"text":"もしや……あなたはルナーランドに行ったことがあるのですか？","source_cn":"难道……你已经去过月影乡了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24658301FE01F3DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012442004:2":{"text":"おぬしに隠し事はできんのう。さすがは、わしの自慢の弟子じゃな。","source_cn":"布莱恩，令我骄傲的学生。什么都瞒不过你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CAD19D6261C3726","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012442005:1":{"text":"そうじゃ、わしはおぬしらよりも先にルナーランドへ辿り着き、そこで鹿霊と出会った。","source_cn":"不错，在你们到来之前，我找到了月影乡的所在，并在那里见...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B9E0E10E5CFED24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012442006:1":{"text":"おぬしらをルナーランドに行かせたのも、鹿霊の御意志じゃ。ミサタ様が会いたがっていると言われての。","source_cn":"我是受鹿灵所托，指引你们前往月影乡。弥萨忒期待着与你们见面。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08580A76392D04A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1012442007:1":{"text":"そしておぬしらは見事試練を突破した。実に誇らしいぞ。","source_cn":"你们成功通过了祂的考验，我很欣慰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01CE266B4B604016","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1012442008:1":{"text":"フォレストエッグを使えば、流光の樹を浄化できるのですか？","source_cn":"使用翡绿之卵，是否能净化流荧树？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34389D5141F99977","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1012442009:2":{"text":"試してみなければ、結論は出せぬよ。","source_cn":"不进行尝试，如何能得出结论。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x289FD2232CD9D82D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1012442010:1":{"text":"マーリン、おぬしは浄化魔法が得意だと聞いたぞ。","source_cn":"梅林大人，我听说你擅长净化魔法。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x340FF570666D7DB8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マーリン、おぬしは浄化魔法が得意だと聞いたぞ。","female":"マーリン、おぬしは浄化魔法が得意だと聞いたぞ。","variant_male_record_index":"110143","variant_female_record_index":"110144","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title